      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/CYBTRAFFIC/status/2022642739192697098",
      "text": "🚨 Traffic Advisory – Outer Ring Road (ORR) 🚨\n\nA 4-Wheeler Rally (approx. 500 vehicles) of MIM has entered the Outer Ring Road (ORR) near Isnapur and is proceeding towards Exit 17 – Rajendra Nagar.\n\n🔹 Motorists may experience slow-moving traffic and intermittent congestion along this stretch.\n🔹 Commuters heading towards Rajendra Nagar and adjoining areas are advised to plan alternate routes and allow extra travel time.\n🔹 Please maintain lane discipline and avoid sudden lane changes.\n🔹 Follow the instructions of traffic personnel deployed on the route.\n\n👮‍♂️ Traffic is being regulated to ensure smooth flow and public safety.\n📢 Kindly cooperate and stay updated through official Cyberabad Traffic Police channels.\n\n#TrafficAdvisory #CyberabadTrafficPolice #ORR #HyderabadTraffic",
